[statement]
A package installed that the world, with the request, no longer reaches is
removed, and so is what only it needed: `a` and `lib` are in no world.

[repository]
P:b
V:1.0-r0

[installed]
P:lib
V:1.0-r0

P:a
V:1.0-r0
D:lib

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove a 1.0-r0
remove lib 1.0-r0
install b 1.0-r0
